comments.body:
@participant1 

Will version 1.70 fix the issue? I only uploads local photos using rclone in the album that rclone created before (**or created using same access_token, client_id, client_secret by a python script copied from clone config**). 

How would I get the new access_token, refresh _token ? I would like to use the same token everywhere in my other python script.

@participant15 

The thing that I did not really take into account is that rclone will only be able to access albums/folders **it has created itself**

I had to move everything into a new album, because I rotated the tokens and therefore the old album was not accessible due to the new restrictions
